#: ../../tools/crossref_tools.rst:187 d6282f1136f4446a8a09af33e0762f9b
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search Crossref Works API for scholarly articles, "
"publications, and research outputs by keyword. Returns metadata including"
" title, abstract, journal, authors, publication year, DOI, URL, "
"citations, and publisher. Supports filtering by publication type (journal"
" article, conference paper, etc.) and date range. Use this to discover "
"academic literature, verify citations, or build bibliographies. Find DOIs"
" to use with Crossref\\_get\\_work for complete metadata."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/crossref_tools.rst:191 42f8336e109c4b43990c98063c419326
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search query for Crossref works. Use "
"keywords separated by spaces to refine your search across titles, "
"abstracts, authors, and other bibliographic fields."
msgstr "``query``（字符串）（必填）用于搜索 Crossref 作品的查询条件。使用空格分隔的关键词以细化搜索。"

#: ../../tools/crossref_tools.rst:194 5861a7fc78564642b4b9b3b754332932
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Number of articles to return. This sets "
"the maximum number of articles retrieved from Crossref. Max 100 per "
"request."
msgstr "``limit``（整数）（可选）返回的文章数量。此参数设置从 Crossref 检索的文章最大数量。"

#: ../../tools/crossref_tools.rst:197 0efa6e68c99247b19141675bd11a3071
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``filter`` (string) (optional) Optional filter string for Crossref API. "
"Examples: 'type:journal-article' (only journal articles), 'from-pub-"
"date:2020-01-01' (published after date), 'has-abstract:true' (only with "
"abstracts). Multiple filters comma-separated."
msgstr ""
"``filter``（字符串）（可选）Crossref API 的可选过滤字符串。例如：'type:journal-article,from-"
"pub-date:2020-01-01'"

